OL,3,AAnthropic shares fall after blockbuster
OL,4,Aopening as wider tech sell-off
OL,5,Acontinues
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite Index
OL,8,Falso fell more than 4% by afternoon
OL,9,Ftrading as shares in major tech
OL,10,Fcompanies continued to fall.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
