OL,3,ATrump threatens ban on US firms
OL,4,Abuilding AI data centres overseas
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said he will ban US
OL,7,Fcompanies from building AI data centres
OL,8,Foverseas, threatening a "tremendous
OL,9,Ftax" for tech firms who do so.
OL,11,F"We're going to keep it all in this
OL,12,Fcountry," the US president said, while
OL,13,Fproviding little detail on the
OL,14,Fpotential policy he said others in his
OL,15,Fcabinet were hearing about for the
OL,16,Ffirst time.
OL,18,FData centres were a central issue in
OL,19,Fthe midterm elections earlier in
OL,20,FNovember, with many Democratic
OL,21,Fcandidates promising tougher regulation
OL,22,Fon their construction.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
