OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGTA 6 drives spike in download demand,
OL,4,Aas estimated sales top $2.3bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FPre-orders and first-day sales totalled
OL,7,Fmore than 24.5 million units, making
OL,8,Fabout $2.36bn (#1.8bn), according to
OL,9,Fanalytics site Sensor Tower.
OL,11,FIn comparison, this year's
OL,12,Fhighest-grossing movie so far,
OL,13,FSpider-Man: Brand New Day, made $2.5bn
OL,14,Fover its entire run in cinemas.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
